  "job_B1.9.7_20260916_191207": {
    "chunk_text": "Lawedum mannum is to witenne, \u00fe\u00e6t hi sceolon healdan heora cl\u00e6nnysse on halgum timan, and on \u00f0am L\u00e6sse pleoh bi\u00f0 \u00feam cristenan men \u00fe\u00e6t he fl\u00e6sces bruce on Lenctentiman, \u00feonne he wifes bruce. On Lenctene sind getealde ealles \u00f0\u00e6s geares teo\u00f0ungdagas, on \u00f0am dagum sceolon cristene men heora Nis \u00f0\u00e6s mannes f\u00e6sten naht, \u00fee hine sylfne on forh\u00e6fednysse dagum fordrenc\u00f0. Se Scyppend, \u00fee eow gesceop, sylle eow godne willan, and eow gel\u00e6de to \u00f0am ecan life..",
